WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.548 line:91%
Chapter 17. Listening, and word cards.

00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:09.947 line:91%
Open "Activities and games", then "Listen and read", then "Listening".

00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:17.787 line:91%
There is a short listening for each lesson of your book, and a longer one for the whole unit. Choose the book and the unit.

00:00:18.242 --> 00:00:27.206 line:91%
The first time, download the audio for your book. Do it once, with internet, at home is fine. Then it works in class with no internet.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:33.488 line:91%
Tap a key word: a card opens, with a simple meaning, an example, and the sound.

00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:42.153 line:91%
Press "Listen first" to hear it yourself. "Print" makes a worksheet, with the text for you.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:47.955 line:91%
Press "Start". Students tap their name on their phones. Then press "Start" again.

00:00:51.594 --> 00:00:58.614 line:91%
There are six steps. First, before listening: the key words, and a guess. Students vote on their phones.

00:00:59.073 --> 00:01:07.834 line:91%
Each phone has help for its level. Starter gets the key words and easier questions. Champion gets extra, harder questions.

00:01:08.295 --> 00:01:13.193 line:91%
Next, listen for the main idea. Press "Play", on the class speakers.

00:01:24.221 --> 00:01:29.166 line:91%
Students answer one question on their phones. You see how many have answered.

00:01:29.629 --> 00:01:34.845 line:91%
Then listen again for the details. Students answer the questions for their level.

00:01:39.575 --> 00:01:45.912 line:91%
Students can also play it again on their phones, with earphones, and a little slower if they need.

00:01:46.368 --> 00:01:52.692 line:91%
Check: the answers, and the text. Tap a sentence to hear it again. It lights up while it plays.

00:01:53.862 --> 00:01:58.271 line:91%
On the phone, "Hear it" plays the part of the text with the answer.

00:01:58.728 --> 00:02:04.312 line:91%
Dictation: play a sentence, normal or slowly. Students type what they hear.

00:02:07.134 --> 00:02:15.032 line:91%
Red words are missing or wrong. With the speaking check on, they also say the sentence, and the laptop checks it.

00:02:15.495 --> 00:02:21.652 line:91%
Last step: speak with a partner, and then write. The texts from the phones appear on your screen.

00:02:24.473 --> 00:02:34.212 line:91%
Word cards are on the phones too. Tap "Word cards" to see all the words of the unit, and play a quick check: the word and its meaning. That's it!
